                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "A new look with no underline. The tabs sit on a soft grey strip; the chosen one is a raised white capsule, and its count turns brand green with white figures. Different from the segmented switch: the strip runs the width of the card and tabs keep their counts.",
