                  "content": "Narrows a list to what you want to see (Jobs, Clients, Requests, Quotes, Invoices, Timesheets, Pipeline, Automations). Resting, it shows its name and \"All\"; once a value is picked it stays marked and gets a cross that puts it back to rest. A sort control always shows its value and never gets marked or a cross. Some chips show only their name until used (Timesheets \"People\").",
