                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Each tag is a soft pill in its own colour (tinted background, darker name, coloured tag icon), the way Notion, Gmail and Pipedrive show labels, so \"VIP client\" is always purple wherever it appears. The tag icon sets tags apart from status pills, which carry a dot instead. The business picks each tag's colour from 10 app colours (below); a new tag gets the next unused one automatically.",
