              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1100,
              "content": "Client, request, quote, job, invoice and payment open with the same header part; only the data changes. Approved by Jafar 2026-10-20 as option C. Changed and approved 2026-10-21 (Batch 52): the top is plain white with no record colour and no status stripe, so the status pill always shows in its own colour; each fact is one line — a 40 icon tile at the left, its title over its value beside it; bigger text for older eyes — sizes from the type scale (Jafar's table, 2026-10-21): title display 28, client name large 16, contact and fact values base 14, fact titles and status pill small 14, track steps label 14, the line under each step 12. Drawn at the real page width (840). No call / text / email buttons. Light and dark mode below.",
