              "content": "Part 1 · communications/ComposerChannelMenu: the Email / Text / Website chat picker at the foot of the inbox reply box, in the folded reply box, and as \"Send by\" in a review request automation. With one channel it is a plain label, no menu. Part 2 · clients/CommunicationSettingsDialog: the client's automatic-message ticks, opened from the client form. Same choices, words and Done in both; only the look changes. Messaging is the Conversation part of the app, so the colour is teal.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-family",
              "fontSize": "$font-size-large",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
