              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Approved by Jafar 2026-10-21: B · Week planner (A refined day cards deleted). settings/WeeklyHoursEditor, on Settings → Business hours and in the setup wizard's hours question. Restyle only: the same seven days, Open / Closed switch, Open 24 hours, up to three periods a day with Start → End and the length chip, Remove this period and Add another period. Nothing is added or taken away. One list, a day per row: a 40 day tile in the Time colour (grey when closed), the switches under the day name, a 24-hour bar with the open periods as Time-coloured blocks, and the Start → End boxes under the bar. The bar only shows; it is not a control. Researched against Google Business Profile, Calendly, Square and Jobber.",
