              "content": "Approved by Jafar 2026-10-21: A · Refined pad (B signing slip deleted). ui/SignaturePad, in Collect signature on a quote and on a job and on the quote the customer opens online. Restyle only: the same Type it / Draw it choice, the paper, the line, the same caption words, Full name and Clear. Nothing is added or taken away. The switch and Clear share one row above the paper; the paper has 12 corners, room to sign and a × mark at the start of the line; Full name sits under the paper. The paper stays white with dark ink in both modes, as today, because the signature ends up in a PDF and on a printout. The chosen switch icon takes the record's colour (Quote pink here; Job green on a job). Researched against DocuSign, Dropbox Sign, Adobe Acrobat Sign and Jobber.",
