          "content": "Approved by Jafar 2026-10-21. Restyle only: every live field, switch, warning, word and button kept (clients/ClientForm). New client: client-sand header card with the Client type and Status switches (chosen option brand green), Primary details as a two-column form with coloured front icons, an optional Client address card; rail Lead source, Tags, Notes, Attachments; save bar Cancel · Save & create another · Save client. Edit client (from the client page's ⋯ menu) leaves out the address, Notes and Attachments, and a customer can't go back to Lead. Fields sunken on white cards (no-blend rule).",
