              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Approved by Jafar 2026-10-21: A · Money in, split out (B one column deleted). invoices/CollectPaymentDialog, opened from an invoice's Collect payment (that invoice is pinned and ticked first) and, as Fix payment, from a payment page. Jobber's New payment shape: one received payment spread across the client's bills that still owe; whatever isn't applied stays with the client as credit. Same fields, words and buttons as the live app: Amount received, Apply to invoices (tick a bill, adjust its amount), Payment method (ten methods, so it stays a dropdown), Payment date, Reference #, Details, then Cancel · Save and email receipt · Collect payment. The payment's own details sit at the left; a blue invoice panel at the right shows where the money goes, with a bar for applied and client credit.",
