              "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Approved by Jafar 2026-10-21: B · When on the left (A one column deleted). jobs/JobVisitDialog: opened from a visit on a Job page and from Schedule when a visit is moved. Jobber's Edit visit shape: the visit's own title, its day and time (or Later, or Anytime), instructions for the crew, who is going, and — only on a recurring job billed per visit — what this one visit bills. Same fields, rules, words and buttons as the live app: Cancel · Save and update future visits (recurring jobs) · Save visit, with Notify customer in the footer. Two approved changes: one Set a time · Anytime · Later switch replaces the two ticks, and the no-day error reads \"or choose Later\".",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-family",
              "fontSize": "$font-size-large",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
