              "content": "Three pop-ups on a job page that decide money or dates. Approved by Jafar 2026-10-21 (\"ok continue\" to the suggested picks): Billing setup B, Payment schedule B and Add an invoice reminder A. Same fields, words and buttons as the live app; only the look changes. Each part shows the approved pop-up, then its states, then dark mode at the bottom. The \"are you sure?\" pop-ups on the job page (remove checklist, expense, hours, reminder, visit) and the form pop-ups follow the patterns already approved and are not redrawn here.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": "$font-size-base",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
