          "id": "C7mcAX",
          "name": "Board scope",
          "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1440,
          "content": "Approved B by Jafar 2026-10-21; option A (choice tiles with an 'Already set for you' checklist) deleted. Step 4 of the New campaign flow: the path one email takes (Sent from → Reaches → They press → It opens) follows the choice; the one real choice is where the email's button goes — one of your published forms, your website, or a phone call. Sender and replies are shown, not chosen; the plan's marketing email allowance is shown; sending now or scheduling stays on the Review step. No new data: button words are the ones the app already sends. Step track hint is now 'Button and replies'.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-family",
          "fontSize": "$font-size-base",
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "cLR7Q",
          "name": "Options · light",
