                  "fontSize": "$font-size-larger",
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "W0ope",
                  "name": "Option description",
                  "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1440,
                  "content": "New concept: the top of the card draws the path one email takes — sent from you → lands in the customer's inbox → they press your button → it opens your form and becomes a request (or a call or a website visit). Each stop updates with your choice. Under the path you choose where the button goes from a simple list; replies and allowance sit as two small cards at the bottom.",
