              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 4,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "KKBoa",
                  "name": "Option title",
                  "fill": "$color-heading",
                  "content": "Approved B · Time as a sentence · 2026-10-22",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$font-size-large",
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "xhDru",
                  "name": "Option note",
                  "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1100,
                  "content": "No pill at all. The age becomes a line of card text, like the created date beside it: a clock, the number in bold and “in stage” in quiet words, so a new teammate understands “4d” without guessing. The table drops the words because its column already says “In stage”.",
